OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight,
OL,6,Fthere may be a few light showers
OL,7,Faround at first, turning drier into
OL,8,Fthe early hours with a few clearer
OL,9,Fspells developing and winds easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA bright start for some on
OL,12,FMonday before cloud and rain move in
OL,13,Ffrom the southwest through the
OL,14,Fafternoon, sometimes heavy. Winds
OL,15,Fstrengthen, with coastal gales
OL,16,Fpossible by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
