OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FRemaining chilly and unsettled.
OL,7,FBlustery, occasionally heavy showers
OL,8,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday with strong
OL,9,Fcoastal winds. Further rain arrives on
OL,10,FThursday with strong winds returning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
